{"kind":"finding","id":"FN-B-alerts-phone-shop-2-b-01","date":"2026-11-26","lens":"gap-4","surface":"phone","area":"phone/shop-2","refs":["F-phone-424","F-phone-407","F-phone-410"],"severity":"S3","title":"When the gym's reply or a pause answer misses its pop-up, the phone never pops it up later","what":"Gym news and trainer replies have two ways to reach the member: the instant pop-up and the phone's own 15-minute check, which pops up anything the instant one missed. The gym's reply to Message your gym, a pause or renew answer and an order note have only the instant pop-up. When it does not arrive (no push address on the phone, the sender down), nothing pops up later. And when that pop-up does arrive with the app open, the red count on the Gym tab is not asked again at once (it is for a trainer reply), so it can wait up to 5 minutes.","expected":"The 15-minute check also looks for a gym reply or answer the member has not read and pops it up once, and an arriving reply updates the red count at once, the same as trainer replies.","evidence":["apps/mobile/src/shop/noticeAlertsRun.ts:329-345","apps/mobile/src/shop/noticeAlertsRun.ts:364-385","apps/mobile/src/shop/pushPlan.ts:96-99","apps/mobile/src/shop/pushPlan.ts:108-111","apps/mobile/src/shop/askReplySync.ts:1-13","apps/mobile/src/shop/gymTalkSync.ts:47-63"],"proof":"code-read","root_cause_key":"gym-reply-no-backup-popup","who":"members who message the gym or ask for a pause or renewal","how_often":"whenever an instant pop-up is lost","fix_line":"Let the 15-minute check pop up unread gym replies and answers once, and refresh the red count when one arrives.","fix_size":"small","needs_him":false,"verified":"pending","status":"open"}
